<title>LATVIA: UNIBANKA ACTIVE ON QUIETER OTC MARKET LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>UNIBANKA ACTIVE ON QUIETER OTC MARKET LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in leading bank Unibanka were the most active on the over-the-counter market last week, which itself was quieter than usual, the bourse said.</p>
<p>Total turnover on the OTC market between April 7 and 11 was 443,512 lats of which Unibanka accounted for 381,535 lats. This compared with official list activity of 801,926 lats.</p>
<p>Valmiera Glassfibre was also active on the OTC market that week, turning over 319,773 lats.</p>
<p>-- Patrick Lannin, Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
